            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "SDK selectors `0x10/0x20/0x30` send `0x913F [0x10000/0x20000/0x30000,0x80000518,0]`. All return `0x2001`. Responses are `[0x80000518,1]`, `[0x80000518,0xFFFFFFFF]`, `[0x80000518,0xFFFFFFFF]`."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "`0x911B [0]` then `0x911C []` both returned `0x2001`."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "The first runner performed an unnecessary second unlock, which returned Busy;"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "Standard `0x1014 GetDevicePropDesc` reads for all six residual properties returned `0x200A DevicePropNotSupported` to the runner, without payload."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| `9197 []` | `2001 OK`, no data;"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| **`9195 [1]`** | **`2001`, 20-byte folder record:** `14000000 000020a3 3130304d5344434600000000`."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| Remote mode `9114 [5]`, event mode `[1]`, restore remote mode `[1]` | All returned `2001`."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| Advertised `9050 []`, `905C []` in a plain PTP session | Both returned `201F TransactionCanceled`."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "The direct Darkgrade PTP path then read `917C [] => 2001 [0]`,"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "and `917D [0] => 2001 [0]` (a response parameter, not a four-byte log file)"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "Two previously unmapped but advertised operations, 9180 and 9181, were each tested with no parameters and no outgoing DATA phase. Both returned 2001, no DATA container and no response parameters."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:docs/camera-compatibility.md",
                "excerpt": "The advertised0x9060 mode query returned0x2001 with no response parameters"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-ptp-position.md",
                "excerpt": "two commands `[3,2984,1856,0]` and `[3,2784,1856,0]`, both0x2001."
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| `9195 []` plus empty data phase; `9195 [0]` | USB disappeared without a response;"
            },
            {
                "location": "darkgrade/test-bench@2db7a28:.agents/skills/camera-re/references/canon-menu-ptp-investigation.md",
                "excerpt": "| `9196 [1]`; same selector with unchanged20-byte folder record as incoming data | Both lost USB without a response."
            }
        ]
    },
